Package: brfutures
Type: Package
Title: Brazilian Futures Data Tools
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Hugo",
    family = "Rzepian Teixeira",
    email = "hugorteixeira@senhormercado.com.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight tools to download, parse, cache, and retrieve B3
    (BM&F Bovespa) futures daily bulletins from the legacy HTML endpoint and
    the BVBG XML reports (via the pesquisapregao SPRD ZIP download), switching
    automatically at a configurable cutover date. Provides update helpers that
    keep a local cache in sync and fast accessors for cached contract data.
License: GPL (>= 3)
